{"articleNo":"74834","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=74834&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013학년도 1학기 수강지도상담 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.01.29","hit":"11646","attachments":[{"name":"원스톱서비스 화면(수강지도 상담).bmp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=74834&attachNo=3089"},{"name":"2013-1학기 교육과정이수 원칙.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=74834&attachNo=3091"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 'HY울릉도M'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2013학년도 1학기 수강지도상담 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2013학년도 1학기 “수강지도상담”을 아래와 같이 안내하오니, 해당 학생들은 수강지도기간에 지도교수와 상담하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">“</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">수강승인”</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">을 받으시기 바랍니다. (수강지도 미승인 학생은 수강신청 페이지 로그인 불가함)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">1. 적용대상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 재학생에 한하여 실시</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">제외자 : 2013학년도 1학기 휴학자,&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffccff; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2월 9일 이후 복학자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2013학년도 1학기 신(편)입생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 36.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -36.8pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">2월 1일부터 2월 8일까지 복학신청기간 동안 복학신청 학생은 수강지도상담 승인 대상자이며, 단 복학생에 한하여 수강지도상담 미승인자도 수강신청 페이지 로그인 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 60pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2. 수강지도상담 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 2013. 2. 1(금) 10:00 ~ 2. 11(월) 18:00까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">3. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">상담내역</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 14pt; TEXT-INDENT: -12pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;교</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">과목 이수체계도 및 졸업요건 등을 충분히 숙지하여 교육과정 이수에 문제가 발생하지 않도록 하며</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">, 부족한 학습 성과 항목을 체크하도록 함. </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 14pt; TEXT-INDENT: -12pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">※『졸업가능여부 확인시스템』은 현재 졸업사정 중으로 재학생을 위해서는 2월 20일경&nbsp;시스템을 오픈할 예정이니 참고바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 13pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><br>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 124.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -124.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">4. 수강지도상담 방법</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 124.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -124.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;지도교수에게 온.오프라인으로 상담을 받은 후 웹상으로 수강승인을 받아야 함.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">가. 지도교수 확인</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> : 수강지도상담 조회 시 지도교수정보 열람 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 72.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -72.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><img height=\"0\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/user/LOCALS~1/Temp/UNI0000159c2d86.gif\" width=\"54\" border=\"0\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;*<font color=\"#0900ff\"> </font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><font color=\"#0900ff\">원스톱서비스 →&nbsp; 상담 → 수강지도상담 클릭&nbsp;&nbsp; </font></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 33.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -33.3pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; 나. 수강지도상담 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 70.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -70.1pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 상담 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff33cc; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">e-mail/ 전화/ 면담</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 등의 방법으로 지도교수와 상담</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 61.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -61.2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 위 상담방법 외 수강지도상담 요청 프로그램은 별도로 없으며, 지도교수와&nbsp; 수강상담이 된 경우 수강승인 여부만 확인하면 됨.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 60pt; TEXT-INDENT: -60pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">상담방법 및 기타사항은 해당 학부(과)와 상의하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 수강지도승인 확인(원스톱→상담→수강지도상담조회)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 수강</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">승인/</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">미</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">승인 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">이 된 경우 : 『승인여부』 화면에 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">“승인”</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">“미승인”</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 표시 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 유의 사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 34.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -34.5pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">가. 수강지도 기간 중 지도교수와 상담을 하지 않아 수강승인을 받지 못한 학생은 수강신청기간에 수강신청을 할 수 없음.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 수강신청 페이지 로그인 불가</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-RIGHT: 2pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 수강지도기간에 수강승인을 받지 못한 학생은 학부 사무실로 문의.</strong></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt; TEXT-INDENT: -24pt; MARGIN-RIG